('Configure and test','We configure the workflow on your sources and test it against available historical data where suitable. Your designated analyst checks the first run before anything reaches you.',V3,True),
('Run','The workflow runs on your agreed schedule, gathering, dating and checking evidence the same way every time.',V4,False),
