approach=shell('approach','Our approach | Second Analyst','A different way to do recurring intelligence work: configured, AI-assisted workflows with every delivered brief reviewed by a designated analyst.',
'''<div class="bg-b"><div class="w"><div class="ph1" style="padding-bottom:12px"><h1>A different way to do intelligence work</h1><p class="lede">Businesses have three broad ways to handle recurring research and intelligence work. Each has its place, depending on the question, available resources and level of expertise required.</p></div>
<div class="ap3"><div><div class="k">Option 1</div><h3>General-purpose AI tools</h3><p>Useful for research, exploration and individual tasks. But recurring work still requires someone to provide context, organise sources, check findings and assemble the output each time.</p></div><div><div class="k">Option 2</div><h3>Analyst teams and research firms</h3><p>Bring experience, depth and judgement to complex questions. However, maintaining that level of involvement for routine monitoring and recurring analysis can be expensive or difficult to justify.</p></div><div class="me3"><div class="k">Option 3</div><h3>A managed intelligence service</h3><p>'''+B+''' is designed for work that needs to happen repeatedly. The scope, sources, rules and outputs are defined in advance. Configured workflows handle the repeatable steps, and a designated analyst reviews every delivered brief.</p></div></div></div></div>
<section class="why3"><div class="w"><div class="in"><h2>Why not use a general-purpose AI tool?</h2><div><p>General-purpose AI tools are useful for individual research and analytical tasks. But recurring work still requires someone to provide context, organise sources, check findings and assemble the output each time.</p><p>'''+B+''' configures and operates a defined process around your recurring requirement. The sources, scope, checks and outputs are agreed in advance, so the work can be repeated without rebuilding the process each time.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="exp3" id="experience"><div class="w"><h2>Experience behind the work</h2>
<div class="exrow2"><img class="ph" src="assets/img/mandhir-dua.jpg" width="300" height="300" alt="Mandhir Dua, founder of Second Analyst"><div class="extx2"><p class="dk-only"><b>Mandhir Dua</b> is a strategy and competitive-intelligence leader with 15 years of professional experience, including 12 years leading global competitive strategy and intelligence within a large multinational organisation, followed by independent advisory work with growing businesses.</p><p class="mb-only s"><b>Mandhir Dua</b> is a strategy and competitive-intelligence leader with 15 years of experience, including 12 leading global competitive strategy and intelligence, then independent advisory work.</p><p>He started '''+B+''' because recurring intelligence is hard to staff and hard to keep consistent. Growing businesses need regular, trustworthy competitive and market intelligence, but rarely have capacity to build a team for every requirement.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="fit3"><div class="w"><div class="in"><div><h2>Who is this designed for?</h2><p>'''+B+''' is particularly relevant to growing and mid-sized businesses that need regular market, competitor or commercial intelligence but do not have dedicated capacity for every requirement.</p><p style="margin-bottom:0">It can also support established strategy and commercial teams that need additional capacity for specific recurring jobs.</p></div><a class="btn am" href="contact.html">Book a diagnostic</a></div></div></section>''')

